<div class="overlay" style="background-image:url(https://yurtsever.org.tr/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ikdden-25-kasim-eylemi-somuruye-gericilige-siddete-boyun-egmeyecegiz-4-444x250.jpeg)"></div>
